guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ A n #i.
  (ClaimFunds( A, n ) @ #i)
 ∧
  ∀ #j. (OnChainDelayedProduce( A, n ) @ #j) ⇒ ¬(#j < #i)"
*/
by sorry

